+        // TOTK: HMMA.16816 with an f16 accumulator on the tensor cores (VK_NV_cooperative_matrix, 16 x 8 x 16 f16 at subgroup
+        // scope): the subgroup's 256-word block holds A row-major (words 0..127, 8 a row), B transposed (128..191: column n,
